The Atlas engine is fetched at build time from Enntity/atlas at the commit in
install/atlas-source.json (AGPL-3.0-only): Atlas-Inf, SparkGLM's GLM-5.3-Flash
series, and the Qwen3.8-Flash-Next series, which includes changes picked from
unmerged Atlas-Inf branches (docs/ENGINE.md).

CUTLASS (BSD-3-Clause) is fetched at build time. The image ships its notice
and the notices of the engine's Rust dependencies under /opt/atlas/notices/.

install/start-node.sh is adapted from SparkGLM's, whose container flags follow
LLooM's Atlas recipe (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 LLooM contributors,
LICENSES/MIT-LLooM.txt).

bench/sd_bench.mjs implements the decode-bench protocol of MiaAI-Lab's
sparkDash (MIT, https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/sparkDash) and imports its
prompts from a local checkout at run time; no sparkDash code or text is
included in this repository.

Model weights are not distributed in this repository. The checkpoint
nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4 remains under its publisher's license; see
docs/LICENSING.md.
